't include 0 or 1: rows 1,3,4,7,8,9,10. Let's list each:\n\n1: [4]\n3: [4]\n4: [3]\n7: [2,3]\n8: [2]\n9: [2]\n10: [3,4]\n\nWe need to cover 2,3,4 exactly once.\n\nWe can think of selecting rows that partition {2,3,4}. Let's enumerate possibilities.\n\nWe need to cover 2: options rows 7,8,9. 3: options 4,7,10. 4: options 1,3,10.\n\nWe need to pick a set of rows such that each element appears exactly once, and no row covers two elements that are also covered by other rows. But rows can cover two elements, e.g., row7 covers 2,3; row10 covers 3,4. So we need to ensure no overlap.\n\nLet's enumerate combinations.\n\n"}}],"created":1790980829,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4185,"total_tokens":4953,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-0xW1VwVHBUDYRwmzTa8yaLVpvRO4vglk","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4185,"prompt_ms":529.285,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12647192353643966,"prompt_per_second":7906.8932616643215,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2397.796,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.1262007822685787,"predicted_per_second":319.87708712500984}}